WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.125
Sharing your screen? Blur names and messages with one click

2
00:00:03.125 --> 00:00:04.931
Alt+Shift+U, the default shortcut, turns the blur off again

3
00:00:04.931 --> 00:00:07.142
Panic hide: Alt+Shift+H by default hides the whole page

4
00:00:07.142 --> 00:00:08.748
Press it again to bring the page back

